{"summary":"A unique card-based rogue-like with more than a hundred hours of content!","description":"Card Quest is a dungeon crawling adventure game with unique card combat. Play with a variety of unique character classes, and customize decks to fit your playstyle. Explore the strategic depth of tactical roguelike gameplay, and crush your enemies.\n\n◙ Diverse Classes:\nPlay as a Rogue, Wizard, Fighter or Hunter. The choice is yours. Each has its own unique gameplay style and 3 custom specializations to add even more variety! Turn your rogue into a Swashbuckler or an Assassin, your wizard into a Pyromancer or Necromancer, your fighter into a Berserker or a Paladin and your Hunter into a Sharpshooter or a Fey Archer!\n\n◙ Powerful Equipment:\nUnlock new items by defeating mighty bosses. There are dozens of different pieces of equipment and items for each class to further customize your heroes; granting them new cards and abilities.\n\n◙ Streamlined Progression:\nLevel up your heroes to increase their stamina and health and gain useful passives and unlock new specializations.\n\n◙ Fantastical Dungeons:\nDungeons to explore. Traverse a city cursed with an undead plague, a dwarven mountain full of dangers and treasure, and an enchanted forest where few come out alive, each with over 12 different areas to explore and lots of items to unlock!\n\n◙ Challenging Enemies:\nFight over 25 different bosses and more than 90 enemies! Many of them with unique skills that require creative strategies to defeat.","esrbNotes":"Violence, Blood, Use of Alcohol","pegiNotes":"Moderate Violence","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RddnJ7qfh7Y?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UUscUK5-W0HhFK0HZ7eR6hgCtjBrboJVwtFjXfUEBtKm7cQySKkqFGBQDd3aJ-UG99JSAwpKrI-fMPf9lrl_u08","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/o3KLr3zk8I_Rc6-Kna4L3h1YNA3xejBxbJ6UINNfRdpcjwtz3xSyhnuBskEQHoZPDHC0lvMWLENqiCYq2StE","https://play-lh.g